{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Being able to cast Counterspell at least once per long rest, having the Extra Attack feature and having received proper training as an Anti-Mage.\n\nYou are a relentless force against magic-wielders, honing your skills to counter and obliterate their arcane powers. You have an Anti-Mage DC \u003d your Proficiency Bonus + your highest Ability Score. You gain the following enhanced benefits:\n\n- Arcane Sight: Your connection to the weave of magic is unparalleled. You gain proficiency in the Arcana skill, and you have advantage on Intelligence (Arcana) checks related to identifying spells and magical effects. In addition, you have Truesight up to 30 feet.\n\n- Disruptive Strikes: When you make a weapon or unarmed attack against a spellcaster and hit, the target must make a Constitution saving throw against your Anti-Mage DC with disadvantage to avoid loosing the effect of an active spell on it, if per the effect of Dispel Magic effect. Additionally, your attacks against spellcasters ignore AC, resistance and immunity granted by spells.\n\n- Antimagic Mastery: You\u0027ve achieved mastery over nullifying magic. Once per long rest, when you hit with an attack against an spellcaster, you can attempt to short-circuit the magical essence within a spellcaster. The spellcaster must make a Constitution saving throw against your Anti-Mage DC or loose the ability to cast spells for 1 minute. Additionally, they receive damage equal to the combined number of spell slots (each spell slot counts as it\u0027s level for calculating the total) they have x their Proficiency Bonus, burning (expending) the spell slots they had. On an successful save, they receive half damage and no other effects.","level":1}],"id":"Custom480fc015-f4ba-4cd8-88ea-69300e92bb4e","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Anti-Magic Champion [SM] [LG]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}